{title: Tu Itni Khubsoorat Hai}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Tu itni khoobsurat [G#] hai,        Fida dee [A#] daar pe [Cm] tere
[Cm] Muqammal ishq ho [G#] mera,        Zara sa [A#] pyaar toh de [Cm] de
[D#] Falak kadamon pe aa jhuke,        Haseen lam [G] haat woh de de
[D#] Tere sang bheeg jaaun main,        Kabhi bars [G] aat woh de de
[Cm] Tere bina jeena [A#] pade,        Woh [G#] pal mujhe naa [Cm] de
[Cm] Ishq ki dast [F] aan,        [G] juda hai [Cm] meri
[Cm] Tu hi dono jah [F] aan,        bak [G] huda hai [Cm] meri
[Fm] Yaar mere sirf [D#] teri,        tishn [Cm] agi lab pe [A#] mere
[D#] Falak kadamon pe aa jhuke,        Haseen lam [G] haat woh de de
[D#] Tere sang bheeg jaaun main,        Kabhi bars [G] aat woh de de
[Cm] Tere bina jeena [A#] pade,        Woh [G#] pal mujhe naa [Cm] de
[Cm] Tu hi shaamil [F] raha,        [G] duaa mein [Cm] meri
[Cm] Naam tera rah [F] aa,        [G] zubaan pe [Cm] meri
[Fm] Zikr tera fikr [D#] teri,        har gha [Cm] di dil mein [A#] mere
[D#] Falak kadamon pe aa jhuke,        Haseen lam [G] haat woh de de
[D#] Tere sang bheeg jaaun main,        Kabhi bars [G] aat woh de de
